# PNGs are never versioned — screenshot runs write full-resolution PNGs, but only the small JPEGs
# (produced by the root `compressScreenshots` task) are committed for the README.
*.png

# …except the iPhone 17 status bar capture. It is not screenshot output, it is the fixture
# IosStatusBarComparisonTest measures the drawn status bar against.
!library/src/test/resources/reference/iphone17_statusbar.png
